# Experiment outputs
# The canonical study artifacts are tracked so that a clean clone can load the
# trained agents, regenerate figures, run the result-dependent tests and verify
# `reproduce --full` byte-for-byte. Regenerated verification runs and any other
# new output directories stay local.
results/*
!results/headroom/
!results/diagnostics/
!results/diagnostics_60/
!results/checkpoint_5_17/
!results/train/
!results/tune/
!results/matched/
!results/eval/
!results/figures/
!results/ablations/
results/reproduce_quick/
results/reproduce_full/

# LaTeX build by-products and local drafts (report/)
report/*.aux
report/*.log
report/*.out
report/*.synctex.gz
report/churnmaster_report2.pdf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
